# AI Coding Agent Update Report - March 31, 2026

**Author:** Bintu Kabongo  
**Date:** March 31, 2026  
**Document Path:** `data/reports/ai_coding_agent_update_2026_03_31.pdf`

---

## Executive Summary

The AI team has officially rolled out the latest update to the coding agent as of March 31, 2026. This update focuses on enhancing debugging capabilities, improving the agent's ability to identify, diagnose, and resolve issues in code autonomously. Early tests indicate improved efficiency in debugging processes, though some challenges remain, including delays in resolving low-priority ticket backlogs.

This document provides a detailed overview of the update, its key features, observed impacts, and plans for future improvements. Additionally, this report addresses recent concerns raised internally and externally regarding the implications of AI-driven development on company workflow, employee morale, and client relationships.

